Z||000004||GT Bastard||10-21-2000||02:19 PM||||Ok, I did some research and came up with the performance #'s for the Wiener car. According to internet sources, it's running a turbo-charged and intercooled 1.6 litre Honda motor making 322hp and 280lbs torque.  It's built on a carbon fibre body with an aluminum frame.  It weighs a surprising 2600lbs!  It also runs and AWD system that was adapted from a Talon Tsi.  This thing stomps-nuts at the track too! 13.8 @ 105mph<P>Not bad for a Weiner car.||||reg||12
