Z||000012||Hank is Here||10-23-2000||10:28 PM||||Well it may not be a fiero but does have some Pontiac blood in it.  <A HREF="http://www.kraftfoods.com/oscar-mayer/wmobile/wm_1995.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.kraftfoods.com/oscar-mayer/wmobile/wm_1995.htm</A>  <P>GT Bastard:  sorry to tell you but "The 1995 model was designed to run like a high-powered touring sedan. It sports a V-8,180 horsepower engine. Theoretically speaking,it hauls buns in excess of 90 MPH. And it takes full advantage of the latest automotive design technology: it's the first WIENERMOBILE<BR>constructed using CAD (computer aided design)<BR>imaging tools."<P>||||reg||1
