Z||000015||hugh||10-26-2000||07:34 PM||||I worked on the air conditioning in one of the original wienermobiles back in 1965/1970.It wasn't anymore than an ordinary car frame with that giant wiener on it.They used to use midgets(I'm sorry if that offends anyone,but I don't know how else to say it)to drive them.The one that drove the one I repaired was a miserable SOB.I got a box of whistles shaped like the weinermobile out of the vehicle and gave them to my kids and all the kids for two streets in every direction.I am sure there were a few parents mad at me.You could hear those damn whistles all day coming from everwhere.||||reg||1
